  "content": {
    "id": "p6-q14-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Simplify each expression, writing each pronumeral in the answer with a positive index.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p6-q14-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x-y^{-1}}{x^{-1}-y}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\frac{x}{y}$\n\nRewrite the negative powers as reciprocals, then cancel the common factor.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x-y^{-1}}{x^{-1}-y}&=\\frac{x-\\frac1y}{\\frac1x-y}\\\\\\frac{x-y^{-1}}{x^{-1}-y}&=\\frac{x(xy-1)}{y(1-xy)}\\\\\\frac{x-y^{-1}}{x^{-1}-y}&=-\\frac{x}{y}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q14-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(x^{-1}+y^{-1})(x^{-1}-y^{-1})$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac1{x^2}-\\frac1{y^2}$\n\nUse the difference of two squares.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}(x^{-1}+y^{-1})(x^{-1}-y^{-1})&=(x^{-1})^2-(y^{-1})^2\\\\(x^{-1}+y^{-1})(x^{-1}-y^{-1})&=x^{-2}-y^{-2}\\\\(x^{-1}+y^{-1})(x^{-1}-y^{-1})&=\\frac1{x^2}-\\frac1{y^2}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q14-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{3xy}{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{3x^2y^2}{x+y}$\n\nCombine the reciprocal terms before dividing.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3xy}{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}&=\\frac{3xy}{\\frac{x+y}{xy}}\\\\\\frac{3xy}{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}&=3xy\\times\\frac{xy}{x+y}\\\\\\frac{3xy}{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}&=\\frac{3x^2y^2}{x+y}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q14-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}{x^{-2}+y^{-2}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{x^2y+xy^2}{x^2+y^2}$\n\nCombine each sum of reciprocals, then divide.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}{x^{-2}+y^{-2}}&=\\frac{\\frac{x+y}{xy}}{\\frac{x^2+y^2}{x^2y^2}}\\\\\\frac{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}{x^{-2}+y^{-2}}&=\\frac{x+y}{xy}\\times\\frac{x^2y^2}{x^2+y^2}\\\\\\frac{x^{-1}+y^{-1}}{x^{-2}+y^{-2}}&=\\frac{x^2y+xy^2}{x^2+y^2}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q14-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$(x^{-2}+y)^{-2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{x^4}{1+2x^2y+x^4y^2}$\n\nCombine the terms, take the reciprocal and square.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}(x^{-2}+y)^{-2}&=\\left(\\frac{1+x^2y}{x^2}\\right)^{-2}\\\\(x^{-2}+y)^{-2}&=\\left(\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2y}\\right)^2\\\\(x^{-2}+y)^{-2}&=\\frac{x^4}{(1+x^2y)^2}\\\\(x^{-2}+y)^{-2}&=\\frac{x^4}{1+2x^2y+x^4y^2}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q14-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$(x^{-2}+y^{-1})^{-1}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{x^2y}{x^2+y}$\n\nCombine the reciprocal terms, then take the reciprocal.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}(x^{-2}+y^{-1})^{-1}&=\\left(\\frac1{x^2}+\\frac1y\\right)^{-1}\\\\(x^{-2}+y^{-1})^{-1}&=\\left(\\frac{y+x^2}{x^2y}\\right)^{-1}\\\\(x^{-2}+y^{-1})^{-1}&=\\frac{x^2y}{x^2+y}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      }
    ]
  },
